      <li><b>Don't refine an artifact you've already enhanced.</b> Refining re-rolls each effect's
        level, drawn from 1 up to its current level — so it halves your invested Hammers on average
        and can never raise them.</li>
      <li><b>Don't trust the Quick Apply button.</b> It optimises only the stat you have filtered and
        happily loads fodder that pushes your three other targets down.</li>
      <li><b>Don't read “89&nbsp;% each” as “89&nbsp;% for the set”.</b> Those are per-stat chances.
